# A17.var06 read-only reproduction guide — draft

Independent postrun review is pending. Preserve the frozen prelaunch source inventory, manifest, and original native files. Do not dispatch SIMLOX or rerun accepted-parent checkers. A later explicit independent reader command will recheck this child's sealed evidence and recovered copies; the evidence-index default command will reconstruct byte pins only.

On the controlled host, first verify that all mandatory original files, the 25 recovered run copies, the accepted J07 `group.sxs` settings, and the installed executable/runtime pins remain available. The manifest's `native_run_directory` is the exact one approved run path; do not substitute an alias or copy path. The selected report was produced from the child `model.sxo` with the frozen settings; the accepted A17 model and J07 control are provenance, not repeated behavior.

Publication verification commands and exact custody paths will be completed after the independent postrun GO and index freeze. Running the author or accepted-parent checkers is not a prerequisite for byte-only publication verification.
